# R13 run outputs (owner policy: compute on cluster, retrieve essential
# evidence only). Tracked per job: final.data, log.lammps, in.lammps,
# sbatch.sh, system.data, thin.log, prod_thinned.sha256. Local-only (for the
# release archive): prod_thinned.dump (~246 MB), equil.dump (~25 MB), the
# Slurm stdout <jobid>.out (a copy of the screen log). Every file, tracked or
# not, is pinned by sha256 in runs_manifest.json.
runs/*/prod_thinned.dump
runs/*/equil.dump
runs/*/*.out
runs/*/THIN_DONE
cluster_snapshot/
